  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 802.03 “HUC 12-digit watershed” means the hydrologic unit code 12-digit watershed as developed by the U.S. Geological Survey (USGS).\n\nSource. #11000, eff 2-1-16; ss by #12808, eff 12-15-19 (See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wt 800)",
